 "finalText": "All done. Here's what was added:\n\n**`backend/BlackPort.Application/DTOs/Crm/LeadDtos.cs`** — new record:\n```csharp\npublic sealed record LeadStatusCountDto(Guid StatusId, string StatusName, int Count);\n```\n\n**`backend/BlackPort.Api/Controllers/Crm/LeadsController.cs`** — new endpoint at `GET api/crm/leads/count-by-status`:\n- Returns `Forbid()` if the caller lacks both `LeadsViewAssigned` and `LeadsViewAll`.\n- Includes only non-merged leads (`MergedIntoLeadId == null`).\n- Users with `LeadsViewAll` see all leads; everyone else sees only assigned leads.\n- Groups by status, orders by count descending.\n\nBuild passes with 0 errors. No existing endpoints or frontend code were touched."
